WEBVTT

00:03.810 --> 00:04.650
<b>So awful.</b>

00:05.940 --> 00:10.190
<b>This is no good, missie.
Ya gotta properly train in cooking, too.</b>

00:10.190 --> 00:12.030
<b>Do you want me to teach you?</b>

00:12.400 --> 00:16.070
<b>It must be hard
if it's like this every day, Kenshin.</b>

00:16.070 --> 00:17.910
<b>It's not that bad, that it isn't.</b>

00:17.910 --> 00:22.330
<b>Miss Kaoru's cooking is good cuisine.
It gets tastier each time you eat, that it does.</b>

00:23.870 --> 00:26.540
<b>A delicacy of sorts, huh?</b>

00:26.540 --> 00:28.670
<b>If you don't like it, don't eat it!</b>

00:28.670 --> 00:31.010
<b>You're eating here for free!</b>

00:31.010 --> 00:33.590
<b>Now that I stopped being a fighter
for hire, I don't have any money.</b>

00:31.550 --> 00:34.680
<b>Oro? Oro?</b>

00:33.590 --> 00:35.760
<b>Don't get so irritated.</b>

00:35.760 --> 00:37.390
<b>Oro? Oro?</b>

00:37.390 --> 00:39.560
<b>Sorry to bother you when you're so busy.</b>

00:39.850 --> 00:42.350
<b>I came by because I'd like
to speak with Mr. Himura.</b>

00:42.640 --> 00:43.560
<b>Oh?</b>

00:43.560 --> 00:45.230
<b>Kenshin, the police chief is here—</b>

00:45.230 --> 00:47.440
<b>Ororo...</b>

00:47.440 --> 00:48.690
<b>Oh...</b>

00:49.900 --> 00:51.940
<b>I have a favor to ask, Mr. Himura!</b>

00:52.280 --> 00:54.030
<b>Oro?</b>

02:23.990 --> 02:28.000
<b>EPISODE 6:
KUROGASA</b>

02:29.080 --> 02:29.960
<b>So...</b>

02:30.460 --> 02:32.590
<b>what is this favor you want to ask of me?</b>

02:33.000 --> 02:35.840
<b>This issue has the prestige
of the police on the line.</b>

02:36.420 --> 02:39.880
<b>We asked all the press
to keep quiet about this,</b>

02:39.880 --> 02:43.600
<b>so I'd like all of you
to keep it a secret, as well.</b>

02:44.010 --> 02:47.810
<b>Actually, we'd like Mr. Himura
to defeat a certain hooligan.</b>

02:48.270 --> 02:49.520
<b>Hooligan?</b>

02:50.770 --> 02:53.020
<b>He goes by the name "Kurogasa."</b>

02:53.440 --> 02:57.610
<b>He targets former Imperialists
active in politics, economics and government.</b>

02:57.610 --> 03:01.820
<b>He is a bloodthirsty murderer who sends
vindication notes of assassination, then slays them.</b>

03:01.820 --> 03:06.740
<b>A top swordsman who has not failed to act
upon any of his notes in the past ten years.</b>

03:06.740 --> 03:09.160
<b>The fact that he keeps
targeting Imperialists...</b>

03:09.160 --> 03:13.080
<b>means he has a grudge
or is trying for social reform?</b>

03:13.080 --> 03:14.790
<b>I think that is a part of it.</b>

03:15.290 --> 03:17.300
<b>But more than that...</b>

03:17.300 --> 03:19.630
<b>Kurogasa enjoys slaying other men.</b>

03:20.510 --> 03:25.260
<b>If he targets an Imperialist in an honorable post,
the police will earnestly work as guards,</b>

03:25.260 --> 03:30.350
<b>and the target himself will use
all his power and money to secure guards.</b>

03:30.640 --> 03:35.810
<b>Kurogasa enjoys breaking through such
impregnable defenses that are set up against him,</b>

03:35.810 --> 03:37.860
<b>and slaying as many men as he can!</b>

03:38.570 --> 03:42.400
<b>When he showed up in Shizuoka
two months ago...</b>

03:42.400 --> 03:48.330
<b>we had 34 fatalities and 56 wounded
among the target, police and guards there!</b>

03:48.620 --> 03:50.410
<b>Hold on a second!</b>

03:50.410 --> 03:55.170
<b>You had Gun Bearing Police stationed
at the time, right? And yet, why...</b>

03:55.170 --> 04:00.170
<b>For some reason, the Gun Bearing Police
were slain immediately...</b>

04:00.170 --> 04:02.340
<b>before they could draw their guns.</b>

04:02.720 --> 04:05.510
<b>According to one who escaped death...</b>

04:05.510 --> 04:09.430
<b>their bodies suddenly stopped moving
as if petrified.</b>

04:10.600 --> 04:13.640
<b>The Nikaido Heiho attack,
Shin No Ippo, huh?</b>

04:13.640 --> 04:14.520
<b>- Huh?
- Huh?</b>

04:14.810 --> 04:15.480
<b>Huh?</b>

04:15.770 --> 04:19.360
<b>That man has kept slaying people so much...</b>

04:19.360 --> 04:23.570
<b>that he's fascinated only by the color
and smell of blood, that he has.</b>

04:24.490 --> 04:26.990
<b>Ten years have already elapsed
in the Meiji Era...</b>

04:26.990 --> 04:29.290
<b>yet a man like him still exists.</b>

04:30.160 --> 04:31.500
<b>Kenshin...</b>

04:33.960 --> 04:35.960
<b>Outside help as a guard?</b>

04:35.960 --> 04:40.090
<b>No, don't need it! We're only talking
about one hooligan here.</b>

04:40.090 --> 04:43.170
<b>Not only is outside help unnecessary,
but I don't need police guards, either.</b>

04:43.170 --> 04:45.930
<b>Mr. Tani, we are facing Kurogasa
of all people!</b>

04:46.430 --> 04:47.970
<b>Watch your tongue!</b>

04:47.970 --> 04:51.720
<b>I raced through a forest of swords and a rainstorm
of bullets, and survived into the Revolution!</b>

04:51.720 --> 04:54.020
<b>Is a mere police chief
going to tell me what to do?</b>

04:54.020 --> 04:59.520
<b>Then you should know all the more
how deadly a murderous sword of a master is!</b>

04:59.820 --> 05:01.940
<b>Hah, I'm fully aware!</b>

05:01.940 --> 05:05.700
<b>That's why I cherry-picked
the most powerful guard troop!</b>

05:03.490 --> 05:11.490
<b>MONEY</b>

05:05.700 --> 05:11.490
<b>Fighters devoted to the famous
Jusanro Tani of the Ground Troops!</b>

05:11.490 --> 05:15.330
<b>Yeah! We've got Mr. Tani's back!</b>

05:15.330 --> 05:18.460
<b>You cops can go home and take a dump!</b>

05:18.750 --> 05:24.170
<b>Besides, do you have no pride
in asking some outside rabble to help you?</b>

05:24.170 --> 05:28.930
<b>Are you saying that this helper is more powerful
than all your men combined?</b>

05:29.680 --> 05:32.850
<b>I'm ashamed to say it, but that is correct.</b>

05:33.140 --> 05:34.100
<b>Wha...</b>

05:34.560 --> 05:35.560
<b>Huh?</b>

05:37.100 --> 05:41.730
<b>I've been listening in, and you've gotten
quite authoritative, Mr. Tani.</b>

05:41.730 --> 05:45.400
<b>You're a different man from when I protected you
from the forest of swords and rainstorm of bullets</b>

05:45.400 --> 05:47.110
<b>in the Bakumatsu Era.</b>

05:49.490 --> 05:53.040
<b>Come on, what do you mean
by "cherry-picked," "most powerful"?</b>

05:53.040 --> 05:56.040
<b>I remember beating up
each and every one of them at least once!</b>

05:57.460 --> 06:01.130
<b>I'm sure it's annoying to have
some outside rabble protecting you,</b>

06:01.130 --> 06:03.670
<b>but can you let it slide
just for tonight?</b>

06:04.000 --> 06:07.170
<b>Oh, of course not! This is an honor
that I don't deserve to receive!</b>

06:07.170 --> 06:08.800
<b>There ya have it.</b>

06:07.170 --> 06:08.800
<b>BAD</b>

06:09.090 --> 06:13.060
<b>So, for tonight, we'll forget
the past and buddy up!</b>

06:13.060 --> 06:14.720
<b>Just for tonight!</b>

06:15.930 --> 06:19.770
<b>Mr. Tani, I will deploy officers
outside, as well. Is that all right?</b>

06:19.770 --> 06:20.900
<b>Do whatever you want!</b>

06:20.900 --> 06:21.770
<b>Oro?</b>

06:21.770 --> 06:23.610
<b>Please do!</b>

06:30.280 --> 06:33.490
<b>Five minutes until the time
on that vindication note.</b>

06:34.160 --> 06:36.500
<b>But is this guy really gonna show up?</b>

06:36.500 --> 06:41.710
<b>Hmm... Well, nothing would be better
than him not showing up, that it would.</b>

06:42.000 --> 06:44.920
<b>They should be asleep already.</b>

06:45.210 --> 06:48.630
<b>Yes. She's going to wake up
early tomorrow...</b>

06:48.630 --> 06:51.140
<b>and prepare a bath
while she waits for us, so she said.</b>

06:51.430 --> 06:53.050
<b>You know, Kenshin...</b>

06:53.050 --> 06:55.390
<b>I'm surprised you accepted this case.</b>

06:55.390 --> 07:00.770
<b>I thought you wouldn't like requests
for Battosai like this one.</b>

07:00.770 --> 07:02.480
<b>Of course I don't like it.</b>

07:02.810 --> 07:05.770
<b>But I can't just let all this be,
that I can't.</b>

07:05.770 --> 07:10.570
<b>If I don't put an end to Kurogasa's evildoings,
more people will be unfortunate...</b>

07:11.360 --> 07:13.530
<b>including Kurogasa himself.</b>

07:15.740 --> 07:19.830
<b>More like, I'm surprised
you were willing to lend a hand, that I am.</b>

07:20.120 --> 07:21.620
<b>The hell ya talkin' about?</b>

07:21.620 --> 07:25.540
<b>There's no way
I wouldn't join a fight this fun!</b>

07:25.540 --> 07:27.800
<b>This isn't a fight, though.</b>

07:28.340 --> 07:31.930
<b>All right, answer one more question
while we're at it.</b>

07:31.930 --> 07:33.010
<b>What is it, that is?</b>

07:33.550 --> 07:36.310
<b>What was that Nikaido Heiho attack,</b>

07:36.310 --> 07:38.850
<b>Shin No Ippo,
you talked about this afternoon?</b>

07:38.850 --> 07:42.980
<b>Maybe you have an idea
who Kurogasa is.</b>

07:43.270 --> 07:45.860
<b>That was two questions,
not one, that was?</b>

07:45.860 --> 07:48.940
<b>Quit nitpicking.
Hurry up and answer.</b>

07:50.070 --> 07:51.820
<b>It's a rumor, that is.</b>

07:51.820 --> 07:53.240
<b>A rumor?</b>

07:53.240 --> 07:55.910
<b>A rumor I heard over a dozen years ago.</b>

07:55.910 --> 07:59.080
<b>If you call that an idea,
it would be an idea.</b>

08:00.580 --> 08:02.460
<b>Wh-What was that scream just now?</b>

08:02.460 --> 08:03.330
<b>That wasn't inside!</b>

08:03.330 --> 08:05.040
<b>That was from outside!</b>

08:06.960 --> 08:10.170
<b>He's coming! Sanosuke and I
will solidify the front end!</b>

08:10.170 --> 08:11.800
<b>All others, follow us!</b>

08:11.800 --> 08:12.550
<b>Hurry!</b>

08:12.550 --> 08:14.430
<b>Hey you! That one is my sword!</b>

08:15.470 --> 08:17.140
<b>Don't feel uneasy, you pork bun!</b>

08:17.470 --> 08:20.310
<b>It's customary for the king
to be positioned in the center!</b>

08:29.610 --> 08:30.860
<b>One o'clock...</b>

08:31.650 --> 08:32.860
<b>He's not coming?</b>

08:33.950 --> 08:35.910
<b>Was it an empty threat?</b>

08:42.290 --> 08:43.790
<b>Here they are.</b>

08:43.790 --> 08:47.250
<b>Daredevil insects.</b>

08:53.170 --> 08:55.220
<b>I can't fall asleep...</b>

08:55.220 --> 08:58.800
<b>I have a strange uneasiness for some reason.</b>

09:02.930 --> 09:06.480
<b>Well, this is Kenshin we're talking about,
so he should be all right.</b>

09:06.480 --> 09:08.730
<b>Sanosuke is with him, too.</b>

09:09.610 --> 09:11.190
<b>You're okay...</b>

09:11.190 --> 09:12.690
<b>right, Kenshin?</b>

09:15.400 --> 09:18.660
<b>One, two, three...</b>

09:18.990 --> 09:22.040
<b>About 14 or 15, I guess.</b>

09:22.040 --> 09:23.870
<b>Less than I expected.</b>

09:24.750 --> 09:26.920
<b>So that's Kurogasa, huh?</b>

09:27.500 --> 09:30.340
<b>I see. Those eyes really are too wicked!</b>

09:30.340 --> 09:31.300
<b>Sano...</b>

09:31.300 --> 09:33.260
<b>I will deal with him.</b>

09:33.260 --> 09:35.010
<b>I'd like to trust Mr. Tani with you.</b>

09:35.970 --> 09:39.550
<b>What are you guys standing around for?
Hurry up and get him!</b>

09:40.350 --> 09:44.100
<b>I paid a ton of money to you guys to hire you!
Do your jobs already!</b>

09:44.560 --> 09:47.060
<b>I'll give quintuple the money
if you defeat him!</b>

09:47.060 --> 09:49.560
<b>I'll look after you for a government post
in the Ground Troops, too!</b>

09:49.560 --> 09:50.520
<b>Quintuple!</b>

09:50.520 --> 09:51.480
<b>Government post!</b>

09:51.480 --> 09:54.070
<b>All right, that government post is mine!</b>

09:54.070 --> 09:56.530
<b>No, that's my spot!</b>

09:56.530 --> 09:59.530
<b>Idiots! Are you throwing your lives away
being demented by desire?</b>

10:12.590 --> 10:15.300
<b>This feeling... So good.</b>

10:15.300 --> 10:20.640
<b><i>So quick! He doesn't jump like Kenshin does,
but his sword gleams in a creepy way!</i></b>

10:20.640 --> 10:24.100
<b>Stand back! You weaklings
won't stand a chance against him!</b>

10:24.390 --> 10:25.930
<b>You're not getting away.</b>

10:27.640 --> 10:29.650
<b>Wh-What was that just now?</b>

10:29.650 --> 10:31.610
<b>My body doesn't move!</b>

10:31.900 --> 10:34.150
<b>No good to run.</b>

10:34.150 --> 10:38.570
<b>Once both sides draw swords,
you slice each other until one dies.</b>

10:38.570 --> 10:41.070
<b>It won't be fun any other way.</b>

10:44.030 --> 10:45.120
<b>Bastard...</b>

10:45.700 --> 10:47.450
<b>What'd you do just now?</b>

10:48.160 --> 10:50.620
<b>My body suddenly feels really heavy!</b>

10:51.080 --> 10:55.590
<b>Oh... To think you can still move
even under Shin No Ippo...</b>

10:56.380 --> 10:58.220
<b><i>Shin No Ippo?</i></b>

10:58.220 --> 11:01.220
<b>Nikaido Heiho attack, Shin No Ippo...</b>

11:01.220 --> 11:03.300
<b>also known as the Isukumi Spell.</b>

11:04.100 --> 11:06.310
<b>I had thought perhaps...</b>

11:06.310 --> 11:08.930
<b>but you really were Kurogasa,
that you were.</b>

11:15.150 --> 11:16.320
<b>Mr. Himura!</b>

11:17.070 --> 11:19.900
<b>Back in Bakumatsu,
back when I was in Kyoto...</b>

11:19.900 --> 11:22.660
<b>I had heard a rumor about a certain man.</b>

11:23.240 --> 11:28.500
<b>A man not belonging to any domain
and solely kept to assassination.</b>

11:29.500 --> 11:32.710
<b>An expert swordsman
who mastered Nikaido Heiho.</b>

11:33.330 --> 11:34.920
<b>Rogue Hitokiri...</b>

11:37.960 --> 11:40.970
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

11:41.760 --> 11:44.600
<b>So, you have heard of me, huh?</b>

11:44.600 --> 11:48.560
<b>I know about you, as well.
The Revolutionary warrior from Choshu...</b>

11:48.560 --> 11:52.600
<b>and user of the ancient sword art,
Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu...</b>

11:52.600 --> 11:56.440
<b>the Hitokiri, Himura Battosai!</b>

11:57.400 --> 11:58.190
<b>Kenshin!</b>

12:00.650 --> 12:03.410
<b>Shin No Ippo is no sorcery.</b>

12:03.410 --> 12:06.030
<b>It is a battle of each other's
fighting spirits.</b>

12:06.030 --> 12:09.540
<b>As long as I keep up a sword aura equal to yours,
it will not affect me, that it won't.</b>

12:10.080 --> 12:14.880
<b>Quietly fall under arrest, Jine.
Otherwise, I will have to take you on.</b>

12:15.380 --> 12:17.210
<b>You?</b>

12:17.960 --> 12:20.970
<b>I couldn't wish for anything
better than that suggestion.</b>

12:21.880 --> 12:25.340
<b>But first, I will fulfill
my vindication note of assassination!</b>

12:25.590 --> 12:28.600
<b>Oh, snap! Mr. Tani, get some spirit
into you to cancel the spell!</b>

12:28.600 --> 12:29.720
<b>That's useless!</b>

12:29.720 --> 12:32.640
<b>Fat, rotten pigs will never be able to cancel it!</b>

12:33.690 --> 12:34.310
<b>Sano?</b>

12:34.600 --> 12:35.940
<b>It's a bit early...</b>

12:35.940 --> 12:37.860
<b>for checkmate!</b>

12:38.820 --> 12:40.230
<b>How's that?</b>

12:44.950 --> 12:46.490
<b>Jine!</b>

12:51.330 --> 12:52.500
<b>I can move my body!</b>

12:56.130 --> 12:57.880
<b>This is amusing.</b>

12:57.880 --> 13:00.670
<b>I have not been this amused
since the Bakumatsu Era.</b>

13:01.090 --> 13:02.880
<b>I change my target.</b>

13:02.880 --> 13:06.390
<b>You will be my next prey,
Hitokiri Battosai!</b>

13:06.800 --> 13:10.140
<b>I will show myself
before you again soon.</b>

13:10.140 --> 13:15.230
<b>Ready yourself a true sword,
not that Sakabato, before then!</b>

13:18.150 --> 13:20.400
<b>Are you all right, Sano, that is?</b>

13:20.690 --> 13:22.940
<b>Yeah. This is nothing.</b>

13:22.940 --> 13:24.030
<b>Mr. Himura!</b>

13:24.400 --> 13:26.160
<b>We should tend to those who fell.</b>

13:26.160 --> 13:28.280
<b>If we hurry, we should still be
able to save them.</b>

13:28.280 --> 13:29.370
<b>Yes!</b>

13:29.370 --> 13:31.120
<b>But Mr. Himura...</b>

13:31.120 --> 13:34.460
<b>now you are the one
who will be targeted.</b>

13:34.460 --> 13:38.000
<b>I don't mind. It actually works out
better for me, that it does.</b>

13:38.460 --> 13:44.590
<b>Kenshin, were you expecting this to happen
from the beginning and that's why you took this on?</b>

13:45.590 --> 13:48.970
<b>Ideally, I would have liked
to settle everything right here.</b>

13:48.970 --> 13:51.310
<b>But that was something
he wouldn't let me do.</b>

13:52.060 --> 13:54.230
<b>Jine the Kurogasa...</b>

13:54.230 --> 13:57.480
<b>Definitely not an easy man to deal with.</b>

14:06.450 --> 14:09.870
<b>Six severely wounded,
three slightly wounded.</b>

14:09.870 --> 14:13.790
<b>They said this is the first time the damage
from a Kurogasa incident has been this light.</b>

14:13.790 --> 14:16.160
<b>I can't genuinely be happy
about it, that I can't.</b>

14:16.460 --> 14:18.210
<b>You really ask for a lot.</b>

14:18.210 --> 14:21.130
<b>It was quite something that nobody died.</b>

14:21.670 --> 14:26.800
<b>By the way, what the hell is Kurogasa's...
Jine Udo's Nikaido Heiho?</b>

14:27.220 --> 14:34.520
<b>Nikaido Heiho is a sword art that uses three
stances. Letter One, Letter Eight and Letter Ten.</b>

14:34.930 --> 14:35.850
<b>ONE</b>

14:34.930 --> 14:39.140
<b>Combining the three letters One, Eight
and Ten, you create the letter for "Taira."</b>

14:35.850 --> 14:36.850
<b>EIGHT</b>

14:36.850 --> 14:38.770
<b>TEN</b>

14:38.770 --> 14:42.110
<b>TAIRA/HEI</b>

14:39.480 --> 14:42.110
<b>That is why they call it "Heiho."</b>

14:42.360 --> 14:45.900
<b>The creepiest, feared and widely known
attack is the ultimate attack.</b>

14:45.900 --> 14:50.320
<b>Shin No Ippo, said to have been
usable only by the founder.</b>

14:51.030 --> 14:53.490
<b>An overwhelming amount of spirit
is slammed into the opponent...</b>

14:53.490 --> 14:55.950
<b>freezing the opponent's body
similar to paralysis.</b>

14:56.330 --> 14:57.960
<b>It's the most secret
of all secret attacks.</b>

14:58.660 --> 15:02.960
<b>However, I thought he would use it
against someone attacking him, that I did.</b>

15:02.960 --> 15:07.210
<b>But he was using it on those who lost the will to
fight and trying to flee so that he could slay them.</b>

15:07.210 --> 15:09.430
<b>That's quite a fiendish way
of using it, that it is.</b>

15:09.720 --> 15:11.470
<b>For sure.</b>

15:11.470 --> 15:14.600
<b>But the most powerful guy
out there is on our side.</b>

15:14.600 --> 15:16.600
<b>So, we'll make it work somehow.</b>

15:16.600 --> 15:18.140
<b>It's not that easy, no it isn't.</b>

15:18.430 --> 15:19.350
<b>Huh?</b>

15:20.900 --> 15:25.940
<b>For the ten years since the Revolution,
I have forbidden myself from slaying men.</b>

15:26.610 --> 15:30.650
<b>Meanwhile, he voluntarily kept
killing this whole time.</b>

15:31.240 --> 15:33.780
<b>This is quite a large difference
as a Hitokiri.</b>

15:34.740 --> 15:38.660
<b>I don't know when and where
Jine mastered Nikaido Heiho,</b>

15:38.660 --> 15:41.420
<b>but when he first appeared in Kyoto
back during the Bakumatsu Era,</b>

15:41.420 --> 15:43.960
<b>they say he was a member
of the Shinsengumi.</b>

15:43.960 --> 15:47.920
<b>Shinsengumi? That's the strongest group
of swordsmen on the Shogunate side!</b>

15:47.920 --> 15:49.760
<b>They're the archnemesis
of the Imperialists!</b>

15:50.550 --> 15:55.050
<b>In reality, he did slay
many Revolutionary warriors.</b>

15:55.050 --> 15:58.180
<b>But even more than that, he committed
unnecessary murders over and over,</b>

15:58.180 --> 16:01.560
<b>and right when he was going to be
disciplined within his unit,</b>

16:01.560 --> 16:05.360
<b>he slayed his attacker
and fled from the Shinsengumi.</b>

16:05.360 --> 16:07.650
<b>And several months later...</b>

16:07.650 --> 16:12.530
<b>he appeared on the Revolutionary warrior side
as a Hitokiri, that he did.</b>

16:12.530 --> 16:15.120
<b>First a Shogunate supporter,
then an Emperor loyalist?</b>

16:15.120 --> 16:17.700
<b>No ideals or causes there.</b>

16:17.700 --> 16:22.040
<b>The only thing that exists in Jine
is the desire to slay other men, that is.</b>

16:22.040 --> 16:26.040
<b>Quite a dangerous manslayer
who moves only from a desire to kill.</b>

16:26.040 --> 16:29.000
<b>And a master who uses a legendary
ultimate attack to boot.</b>

16:29.630 --> 16:32.010
<b>This might not be a scene for me.</b>

16:32.010 --> 16:34.300
<b>He is after me and me alone.</b>

16:34.300 --> 16:36.720
<b>I will take him alone, that I will.</b>

16:37.100 --> 16:42.430
<b>I won't say this is something in return,
but I would like to ask a favor of you, that I do.</b>

16:42.430 --> 16:44.270
<b>KAMIYA KASSHIN
SCHOOL OF KENDO</b>

16:43.600 --> 16:47.190
<b>Jeez, what a sloppy-lookin' face!</b>

16:47.190 --> 16:50.230
<b>A girl in her prime
shouldn't be drooling in her sleep.</b>

16:50.230 --> 16:53.400
<b>Looks like she couldn't get
a wink in last night.</b>

16:53.400 --> 16:54.320
<b>Hmph.</b>

16:54.860 --> 16:56.570
<b>Hey missie, wake up!</b>

16:56.570 --> 16:57.530
<b>Hmm?</b>

16:57.780 --> 16:58.490
<b>Hey!</b>

16:58.830 --> 17:00.080
<b>Wake up.</b>

17:03.080 --> 17:04.920
<b>Welcome back!</b>

17:04.920 --> 17:06.290
<b>Yeah, I'm back.</b>

17:06.670 --> 17:09.340
<b>Huh? Wait, where's Kenshin?</b>

17:09.340 --> 17:11.300
<b>Kenshin ain't comin' back.</b>

17:13.840 --> 17:18.220
<b>So, Kenshin became the target instead.</b>

17:18.600 --> 17:21.770
<b>And he asked me to be here
while he's gone.</b>

17:22.020 --> 17:23.640
<b>Where did Kenshin go?</b>

17:23.640 --> 17:25.640
<b>He said he'd head out
to the riverbank for now.</b>

17:26.150 --> 17:30.070
<b><i>Hitokiri often centered activities
around rivers during the Bakumatsu Era...</i></b>

17:30.070 --> 17:32.990
<b><i>due to ease of both attack and escape.</i></b>

17:32.990 --> 17:35.200
<b><i>I'm sure it will be easy
to find Jine at a riverbank.</i></b>

17:35.490 --> 17:36.910
<b>Or so he said.</b>

17:37.490 --> 17:38.780
<b>Come on now, where're ya headed?</b>

17:39.490 --> 17:41.870
<b>That should be obvious!
I'm gonna look for Kenshin!</b>

17:41.870 --> 17:43.540
<b>Don't be stupid!</b>

17:43.540 --> 17:47.080
<b>Jine isn't your ordinary enemy!
You don't get it even seeing this?</b>

17:47.420 --> 17:50.710
<b>Even if you go,
all you will do is drag him down!</b>

17:50.710 --> 17:52.920
<b>You should sit still here!
That's the best—</b>

17:52.920 --> 17:58.390
<b>Then what if Kenshin never comes back after
fighting Jine and decides to go on another journey?</b>

17:58.800 --> 18:02.850
<b><i>As a rurouni, I don't know
when I will wander to the next place.</i></b>

18:02.850 --> 18:04.810
<b><i>But if that's fine with you...</i></b>

18:05.680 --> 18:07.600
<b>Father died.</b>

18:07.600 --> 18:09.400
<b>Kihei betrayed me.</b>

18:09.400 --> 18:12.070
<b>And if Kenshin leaves me...</b>

18:13.860 --> 18:17.990
<b>If I'm going to be all alone again,
I'd rather see myself in danger!</b>

18:20.830 --> 18:24.540
<b>She's feeling so uneasy
about being apart from Kenshin, huh?</b>

18:24.540 --> 18:26.660
<b>What a selfish girl we've got!</b>

18:27.080 --> 18:31.170
<b>Well, you can't separate romance
and selfishness, so I guess you can't help it.</b>

18:31.590 --> 18:33.920
<b>But still, she said "all alone."</b>

18:33.920 --> 18:36.050
<b>I guess she's completely
forgotten about you.</b>

18:36.050 --> 18:37.510
<b>Nothing I can do about that!</b>

18:37.510 --> 18:40.140
<b>We're dealing with Kenshin,
the best guy in Japan!</b>

18:40.550 --> 18:43.720
<b>By the way, the second best guy
in Japan is me! Got that?</b>

18:43.720 --> 18:46.930
<b>That means I'm third best in Japan?</b>

18:47.230 --> 18:50.900
<b>Well, I'm gonna take a bath
and pass out, so keep at it!</b>

18:50.900 --> 18:52.770
<b>Kenshin is relying on you!</b>

18:52.770 --> 18:54.980
<b>You should feel more responsible!</b>

19:02.320 --> 19:06.660
<b><i>There must have been a large storm
upstream. The river has risen.</i></b>

19:06.660 --> 19:09.500
<b><i>If I fall in,
that would be the end of me.</i></b>

19:11.960 --> 19:13.040
<b><i>He's here!</i></b>

19:15.250 --> 19:17.760
<b>Kenshin!</b>

19:17.760 --> 19:20.010
<b>I found you!</b>

19:20.300 --> 19:21.300
<b><i>Oro...</i></b>

19:21.300 --> 19:24.350
<b><i>She's even scarier than Jine, that she is!</i></b>

19:25.100 --> 19:26.890
<b>I heard from Sanosuke.</b>

19:26.890 --> 19:29.560
<b>I heard you weren't coming back
to the dojo for a while.</b>

19:31.690 --> 19:34.980
<b>I won't go back, either.
I'll stay here together with you.</b>

19:37.650 --> 19:41.450
<b>Miss Kaoru, did you get into an argument
with Sanosuke, that you have?</b>

19:41.450 --> 19:42.820
<b>Or perhaps Yahiko?</b>

19:42.820 --> 19:43.660
<b>Nope.</b>

19:46.080 --> 19:48.250
<b>You heard about Jine, that is?</b>

19:48.540 --> 19:50.620
<b>I have. But I won't go home.</b>

19:51.040 --> 19:55.840
<b>If I were to fight while protecting someone,
there is no way I can win against Jine.</b>

20:01.590 --> 20:02.590
<b>Miss Kaoru?</b>

20:05.220 --> 20:08.850
<b>My favorite indigo ribbon...
I'll lend it to you, Kenshin.</b>

20:09.600 --> 20:11.640
<b>Oh, even if I borrow it—</b>

20:11.640 --> 20:12.730
<b>Shut up and take it!</b>

20:12.730 --> 20:13.730
<b>Okay!</b>

20:14.020 --> 20:14.860
<b>Listen up.</b>

20:14.860 --> 20:16.820
<b>I'm only lending it to you.</b>

20:16.820 --> 20:17.940
<b>You have to return it.</b>

20:20.030 --> 20:21.860
<b>After you fight Jine...</b>

20:22.240 --> 20:26.700
<b>if you forget to and embark on a journey,
I'll never forgive you!</b>

20:29.370 --> 20:30.330
<b>All right.</b>

20:30.620 --> 20:32.710
<b>I will make sure
to return it to you,</b>

20:32.710 --> 20:35.080
<b>so rest assured and wait for me
at the dojo, that you will.</b>

20:38.670 --> 20:39.840
<b>Okay.</b>

20:44.800 --> 20:46.050
<b>Miss Kaoru!</b>

20:46.760 --> 20:49.100
<b>I saw it! I saw it, Battosai!</b>

20:49.100 --> 20:51.770
<b>This little girl is your woman!</b>

20:52.060 --> 20:53.230
<b>Jine, you bastard!</b>

20:53.230 --> 20:54.980
<b>Anger! Be angry!</b>

20:54.980 --> 20:59.150
<b>That way, you will return further
toward your past self from ten years ago!</b>

20:59.150 --> 21:02.240
<b>Back to the most powerful,
peerless, legendary Hitokiri!</b>

21:02.530 --> 21:04.070
<b>That's where I will be waiting...</b>

21:04.070 --> 21:05.530
<b>Battosai!</b>

21:04.070 --> 21:05.530
<b>VINDICATION NOTE
OF ASSASSINATION</b>

21:05.530 --> 21:06.820
<b>Kenshin!</b>

21:12.450 --> 21:15.000
<b><i>Jine!</i></b>

22:44.960 --> 22:49.930
<b>NEXT EPISODE
THE TWO HITOKIRI</b>

22:46.050 --> 22:46.970
<b><i>Next episode...</i></b>

22:47.470 --> 22:49.130
<b><i>"The Two Hitokiri."</i></b>
